== Repeating the illustration

The sample is a typesetting exercise, so there is no external experiment to run.
Its table values are written directly in the chapter source. Recompile the
document after changing them and check that the table, captions and references
remain correct. The appendix shares the body's continuing Arabic page numbers,
while its headings restart at A.
